Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.15,0:00:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,在進入工業時代後
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.79,0:00:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,社會產生的巨大變革\N（出品FALENO)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.16,0:00:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,各位聽懂了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.33,0:00:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我聽懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.50,0:00:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你們要記筆記哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.60,0:00:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,就個人的貢獻來說
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.50,0:00:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,這是功不可量的 在這其中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.17,0:00:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,而且也是出類拔萃影響深遠的\N（友田彩也香）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.91,0:00:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,各位大家好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.51,0:00:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我是友田
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.41,0:00:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我已經做了三年老師了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.38,0:00:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,今年換到了一家新的學校
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.22,0:00:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,成爲了三年級的班主任
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.15,0:00:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,並且遇到了很多頭疼的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.55,0:00:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,必頂要好好努力才行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.42,0:00:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你們記筆記的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.12,0:00:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,記筆記了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.53,0:00:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,人類的歷史
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.66,0:00:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,有些事物看似毀滅的但事實上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.70,0:00:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,卻轉變爲新的方式\N繼續存在世間
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.94,0:00:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,道理這種東西
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.77,0:00:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,就歷史角度來解說的話
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.01,0:00:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,在現實當中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.41,0:00:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,這個地方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.65,0:01:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.98,0:01:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,這條記住了考試會出的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.15,0:01:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我有一個難以開□的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.59,0:01:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,就是我特別喜歡精液的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.26,0:01:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,只要周圍有一點點
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.30,0:01:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,類似的味道的話
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.80,0:01:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我就會難以自拔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.63,0:01:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我那個地方就會變得溼漉漉的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.24,0:01:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,這個地方要畫重點哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.08,0:01:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,啊以此為鑒的話
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.45,0:01:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,一些豐功偉業的成就
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.12,0:01:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,既能安撫於民心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.62,0:01:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,也能激勵更多的能人志士
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.65,0:01:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,也能側面的影響\N以及開化人們的思維觀念
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.12,0:01:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,而我在學校裡面\N遇到的最色情的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.69,0:01:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,就來講給你們聽吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.46,0:03:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好臭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.21,0:04:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.85,0:05:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.89,0:05:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.10,0:05:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.30,0:05:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,搞得我都興奮了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.22,0:06:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,老師
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.06,0:06:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我東西忘拿了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.10,0:06:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你在幹什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.57,0:06:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,神崎君
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.17,0:07:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你居然把內褲放在教室裡面
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.71,0:07:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你在學校裡面做些什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.64,0:07:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,這個是因為
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.88,0:07:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,喝的時候不小心遺精了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.38,0:07:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,就把它放這裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.68,0:07:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟挺噁心的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.52,0:07:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,然後我就
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.99,0:07:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,看到你在做奇怪的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.79,0:07:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我才沒有做什麼奇怪的事情呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.13,0:07:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你剛是不是自慰了呀老師
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.87,0:07:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,才沒有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.13,0:07:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,快拿走走開
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.14,0:07:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,居然聞我的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.61,0:07:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,而且還在自慰
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.41,0:07:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我才沒有做那種事情呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.38,0:07:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是個變態啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.15,0:07:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不是變態呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.48,0:07:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.35,0:07:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,比較喜歡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.46,0:07:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,聞味道而已
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.69,0:07:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,快拿走 滾蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.60,0:07:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,很喜歡聞味道嗎 老師
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.80,0:08:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那豈不是特別變態
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.77,0:08:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,老師
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.94,0:08:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,才沒那回事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.17,0:08:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你很喜歡聞味道嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.81,0:08:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,老師
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.61,0:08:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你在幹什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.04,0:08:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我有個大膽的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.61,0:08:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那你就聞一下我的味道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.58,0:08:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是很喜歡嗎 老師
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.92,0:08:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,老師來吧 來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.32,0:08:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,萬一被別人發現怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.12,0:08:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.59,0:08:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,這副摸樣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.29,0:08:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.29,0:08:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是一路跑過來的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.36,0:08:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,來聞一聞這個味道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.90,0:08:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.44,0:08:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,來聞一聞
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.41,0:08:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好臭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.18,0:08:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟出了很多汗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.98,0:08:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,來吧來吧 聞一聞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.39,0:08:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,很好很好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.89,0:09:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,老師你很喜歡這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.89,0:09:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你有沒有清洗過
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.80,0:09:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好臭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.24,0:09:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我都不怎麼清洗的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.04,0:09:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,來吧 老師是不是很興奮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.74,0:09:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,才沒有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.81,0:09:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,有人來了怎麼辦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.91,0:09:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,這沒什麼需要擔心的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.82,0:09:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,來舔一舔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.75,0:09:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,再舔乾淨一點
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.83,0:09:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼樣的味道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.36,0:09:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,很臭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.50,0:09:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那你還這麼狂熱的去聞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.34,0:09:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.98,0:09:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,蛋蛋也來聞一聞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.61,0:09:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,很臭的喲
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.86,0:10:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不好好清洗是不行的喲
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.43,0:10:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,有這回事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.87,0:10:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是太爽了 繼續繼續
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.10,0:10:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.34,0:10:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣子好刺激啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.64,0:10:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,快受不了了已經
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.51,0:10:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,接著去聞一聞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.55,0:10:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,真的好臭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.12,0:10:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,看起來真是好爽啊 我的天
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.16,0:10:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,老師味道是不是很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.93,0:10:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼可能呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.34,0:10:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,來吧老師
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.04,0:10:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,來這邊來聞一聞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.11,0:10:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,這邊也一起來聞一聞
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.41,0:10:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你這個姿態真是不成體統
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.84,0:11:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是很喜歡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.38,0:11:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是很臭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.45,0:11:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,來吧來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.42,0:11:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣啊 感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.47,0:11:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.80,0:11:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好臭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.58,0:11:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是有點欲求不滿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.71,0:11:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,才不是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.75,0:11:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.12,0:11:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,就是這一邊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.69,0:11:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,真的好厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.99,0:11:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,這感覺真的是不得了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.96,0:11:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,老師
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.83,0:11:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不好好洗乾淨是不可以的喲
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.34,0:12:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你都沒有洗乾淨嗎真是的\N你不是最喜歡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.84,0:12:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,沒什麼時間管這些呀
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.61,0:12:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是很臭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.55,0:12:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是好興奮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.95,0:12:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,這是什麼情況
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.23,0:12:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,老師是不是興奮起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.70,0:12:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是興奮起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.67,0:12:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,來啊老師你看一看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.70,0:12:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是很臭啊你看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.41,0:12:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,這可是在教室哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.71,0:12:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是很想聞一聞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.69,0:12:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣感覺老師
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.06,0:12:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好臭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.17,0:13:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服老師
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.64,0:13:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,很好老師
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.31,0:13:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,光是聞味道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.02,0:13:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是有點忍不住了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.39,0:13:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好臭的味道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.96,0:13:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你在搞什麼鬼啊\N弄出來這麼多
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.67,0:13:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,老師啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.47,0:13:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是好變態啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.77,0:13:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.91,0:13:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,沒想到你是這樣的老師
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.89,0:14:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.43,0:14:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,很棒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.24,0:14:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,很喜歡這樣的肉棒嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.31,0:14:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,才不是這麼回事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.45,0:14:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,老師你還嘴硬
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.68,0:14:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,快點射出來然後再回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.85,0:14:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不然有人來了怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.52,0:14:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你在說什麼呀老師
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.66,0:14:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,先自慰的人不是你嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.20,0:14:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,來吧老師
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.60,0:14:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣舒服嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.91,0:14:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好好舔一舔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.72,0:15:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好臭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.42,0:15:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好好品嚐一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.33,0:15:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.50,0:15:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,來再靠近一點吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.13,0:15:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.40,0:15:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,真的好舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.03,0:16:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是超舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.62,0:16:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.49,0:16:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好臭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.46,0:16:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,都已經流出□水出來了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.26,0:16:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是很想要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.75,0:17:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是好舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.78,0:17:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,太舒服了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.40,0:17:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好爽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.01,0:17:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.63,0:17:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,真的好臭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.66,0:18:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,很臭嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.31,0:18:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.05,0:18:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是太爽了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.88,0:18:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是好爽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.92,0:19:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是好厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.96,0:19:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,繼續舔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.73,0:19:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不要停下來
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.24,0:19:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.98,0:19:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,萬一有人來怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.48,0:19:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼要這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.15,0:19:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.79,0:19:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是很激烈啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.37,0:19:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.70,0:19:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,這手法好棒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.58,0:19:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是好厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.51,0:19:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,很好老師就爆這樣子舔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.79,0:20:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,真的好舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.78,0:20:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.74,0:20:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.38,0:20:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害呀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.01,0:21:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.24,0:21:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,老師繼續聞一聞我的身體吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.52,0:21:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你如果不洗乾淨的話
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.29,0:21:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,會有一股很騷的味道哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.99,0:21:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不是很喜歡這種感覺啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.21,0:21:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是超舒服的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.77,0:21:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,真的好舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.08,0:21:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.05,0:21:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,來接著舔一舔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.52,0:21:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣子會很舒服的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.32,0:21:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,對對對
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.92,0:21:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,接著舔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.33,0:21:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,真的好厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.60,0:21:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是感覺很棒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.30,0:22:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.75,0:22:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好臭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.31,0:22:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,真的好舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.99,0:22:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,繼續擼起來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.06,0:22:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,老師手動起來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.07,0:23:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.95,0:23:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是好舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.89,0:23:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,來擼起來舔一舔
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.03,0:23:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,像這樣子嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.67,0:23:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.97,0:23:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是好厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.08,0:23:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,都已經流了那麼多水了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.58,0:23:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,老師快點
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.12,0:23:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,快射出來了 快點用手擼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.65,0:24:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,快點擼吧 快射出來了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.36,0:24:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我說你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.63,0:24:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我的老天
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.67,0:24:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你居然射出來這麼多
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.54,0:24:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,射出來好多
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.65,0:24:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.06,0:24:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好臭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.54,0:25:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,要對大家保密哦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.52,0:25:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,體育倉庫的味道也好棒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.23,0:25:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,充滿了男人味
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.54,0:25:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.91,0:25:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你在幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.31,0:26:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是在拿球而已
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.11,0:26:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.82,0:26:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我下午沒有課
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.88,0:26:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,就想偷懶睡個覺
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.29,0:26:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不要暴露給其他老師知道哦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.09,0:26:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不然也會很麻煩的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.63,0:26:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那我先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.10,0:26:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你慢慢睡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.54,0:26:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,還在睡覺嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.35,0:26:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我都已經玩累了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.79,0:26:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,老師
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.40,0:26:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他睡著了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.53,0:27:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,老師
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.00,0:27:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然看起來挺沒出息的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.57,0:27:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你的肉棒卻那麼大
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.47,0:28:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,這個肉棒挺男人的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.21,0:28:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,就有一股味道
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.98,0:28:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,這種味道
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.62,0:28:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,真的好興奮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.56,0:29:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,可以稍微讓我玩一下嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.95,0:29:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,討厭
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.66,0:29:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,居然這麼堅硬
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.70,0:29:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,一抖一抖的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.12,0:30:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,這肉棒挺不錯的呀
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.20,0:30:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒的味道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.47,0:30:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好美味
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.46,0:31:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好香的味道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.89,0:32:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,根本受不了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.51,0:32:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.88,0:32:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你在幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.48,0:32:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,安靜一點
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.62,0:32:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,在幹什麼呀
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.42,0:32:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣真的好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.52,0:32:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,這麼硬邦邦的肉棒
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.36,0:32:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你受得了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.83,0:33:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-等等你先不要這樣子\N-你就不想做點開心的情嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.10,0:33:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,萬一暴露了你也接受嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.97,0:33:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,想做想做
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.04,0:33:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,等一等
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.51,0:33:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好難爲情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.71,0:33:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,老師
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.38,0:33:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,居然有這麼硬邦邦的肉棒
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.72,0:33:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,而且好棒的味道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.89,0:33:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好淫蕩的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.79,0:33:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣不太好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.73,0:33:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,真的有一股味道哦
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.63,0:33:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,等一等
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.47,0:33:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你如果發出很大的聲音的話
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.04,0:33:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,會有人來的喲
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.86,0:33:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,再索吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.06,0:34:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣不太好吧 很髒的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.26,0:34:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,要的就是這個效果
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.79,0:34:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我要的就是這個味道
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.86,0:34:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我才剛上過體育課沒侈久啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.60,0:34:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好臭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.30,0:34:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,等一等
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.91,0:34:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我最喜歡聞這個味道了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.78,0:34:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,真的好厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.69,0:34:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好臭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.32,0:34:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,沒那麼誇張吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.29,0:34:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.16,0:34:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,沒想到你居然這麼變態
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.28,0:34:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,等等啊 老師
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.46,0:35:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,萬一被學生發現怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.37,0:35:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,誰讓你睡在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.27,0:35:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,而且肉棒還這麼堅硬
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.71,0:35:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.55,0:35:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.16,0:35:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎麼這麼熟練啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.28,0:36:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你看你的肉棒一抖一抖的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.46,0:36:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好有感覺啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.34,0:36:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,看老師舔的姿態好棒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.24,0:36:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,啊太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.48,0:36:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是讓我受不了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.99,0:36:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,來吧老師
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.51,0:37:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你也想要的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.28,0:37:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,有點忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.35,0:37:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,老師啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.92,0:37:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你看你穿著這麼性感幹嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.56,0:37:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,屁股挺不錯的呀
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.84,0:37:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.88,0:37:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,這個味道好棒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.08,0:37:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 太棒了 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.05,0:37:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那我把上面的衣服也脫了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.70,0:38:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣是不是很舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.00,0:38:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那我再摸一摸吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.29,0:38:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你也上癮了對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.00,0:38:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我也很喜歡這個味道
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.11,0:38:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.98,0:38:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,根本受不了這個味道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.92,0:38:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-我也是啊好爽啊\N-很爽對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.00,0:39:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,真拿你沒辦法老師
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.62,0:39:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是興奮起來了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.89,0:39:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒啊老師
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.23,0:39:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,看著樣子挺好爽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.33,0:39:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,快停下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.00,0:39:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,讓我嚐一嚐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.81,0:39:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,讓我品嚐一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.38,0:40:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.49,0:40:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.24,0:40:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,萬一有人來了怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.74,0:40:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.98,0:40:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是太有感覺了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.02,0:40:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.39,0:40:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.96,0:40:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,可以讓我再看一看嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.45,0:41:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以看一下屁股嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.79,0:41:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.19,0:41:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好漂亮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.70,0:41:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,等一等
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.07,0:41:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,可以聞一下這個味道嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.61,0:41:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,老師你也是個變態呀
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.18,0:41:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.29,0:41:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,現在這樣子會受不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.50,0:41:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.84,0:42:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,老師啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.54,0:42:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.52,0:42:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,都已經濕透了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.12,0:42:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.56,0:42:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,濕透了對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.69,0:42:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,很爽對不對呀
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.59,0:42:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,盡情的爽一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.36,0:42:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.77,0:42:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼可以這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.27,0:42:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,快停下來
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.21,0:42:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,如果就這樣插進來的話
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.92,0:42:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,看樣子都已經濕透了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.35,0:42:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.39,0:42:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,都已經濕透了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.56,0:43:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.54,0:43:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了已經
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.37,0:43:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.47,0:43:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.51,0:43:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.46,0:43:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,都已經濕透了
